dialogue.Monde.rumeur = Any news from the road?
dialogue.Monde.aurevoir = Safe travels.
dialogue.Monde.retour = Something else…
dialogue.Monde_Marchand.accueil = I go from village to village with my wares. Friends of my village get my best prices.
dialogue.Monde_Marchand.troc = Show me what you sell.
dialogue.Monde_Marchand.npc = Peddler
dialogue.Monde_Marchand.role = Travelling merchant
dialogue.Monde_Pelerin.accueil = I'm walking to the next village. The roads aren't safe anymore, you know.
dialogue.Monde_Pelerin.escorte = I'll walk with you to the end.
dialogue.Monde_Pelerin.escorteTexte = Thank you! Stay close until we reach the village, they'll know what you did.
dialogue.Monde_Pelerin.npc = Pilgrim
dialogue.Monde_Pelerin.role = Pilgrim
dialogue.Monde_Messager.accueil = I carry a letter for the next village. If you're going that way, I'd gladly head home…
dialogue.Monde_Messager.lettre = Give it to me, I'll deliver it.
dialogue.Monde_Messager.paix = What if it were a peace letter?
dialogue.Monde_Messager.npc = Messenger
dialogue.Monde_Messager.role = Messenger
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.accueil = Our beasts are loaded for the next village. An escort would be welcome.
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.troc = What are you carrying?
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.escorte = I'll escort you.
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.escorteTexte = Perfect. Keep your eyes open halfway: that's where they strike.
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.npc = Caravan leader
dialogue.Monde_Caravane.role = Caravan leader
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.accueil = Come in, traveller! There's always a hot soup for whoever walks this road.
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.repas = I'd like a meal.
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.voyageurs = What did the travellers leave?
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.tableau = The news board?
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.tableauTexte = News from all around, and mail waiting for a carrier.
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.lettre = I'll carry a letter.
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.npc = Innkeeper
dialogue.Monde_Aubergiste.role = Relay inn
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Hunters.accueil = Game is scarce. Bring us five raw meats and we'll give you leather.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Hunters.quete = Here's the meat.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Hunters.npc = Huntress
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Hunters.role = Hunters' camp
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Woodcutters.accueil = We cut wood far from home and bread is short. Three loaves for some sap?
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Woodcutters.quete = Here's some bread.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Woodcutters.npc = Woodcutter
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Woodcutters.role = Woodcutters' camp
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Prospectors.accueil = We found ore, but raiders are prowling. Help us drive them off and you'll get your share.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Prospectors.quete = Let them come.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Prospectors.npc = Prospector
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Prospectors.role = Prospectors' camp
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Merchants.accueil = A halt for a few days, long enough to sell what we've got.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Merchants.quete = Let's see your stalls.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Merchants.npc = Merchant
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Merchants.role = Merchants' halt
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Refugees.accueil = The raid burned our home. We're waiting for it to be rebuilt… a little food would help.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Refugees.quete = I'll give you food.
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Refugees.npc = Refugee
dialogue.Monde_Camp_Refugees.role = Refugee camp
dialogue.Monde_Enfants.accueil = Will you play with us? We hide, and you look for us!
dialogue.Monde_Enfants.jouer = All right, I'm counting!
dialogue.Monde_Enfants.non = Another time.
dialogue.Monde_Enfants.npc = Child
dialogue.Monde_Enfants.role = Village child
dialogue.Monde_Fete.accueil = The granaries are full, tonight we celebrate the harvest! Every offering counts double.
dialogue.Monde_Fete.offrir = I bring food.
dialogue.Monde_Fete.npc = Festival host
dialogue.Monde_Fete.role = Harvest festival
dialogue.Monde_Foire.accueil = Welcome to the fair! Merchants of every people are here. And the flag race awaits you.
dialogue.Monde_Foire.course = I'm in the race!
dialogue.Monde_Foire.npc = Fair master
dialogue.Monde_Foire.role = Fair of the peoples
