world.trace.ruin.title = Ancient ruins
world.trace.ruin.1 = Stones cut by a forgotten people. The elders of {village} say a city stood here before theirs.
world.trace.ruin.2 = A half-buried wall, carved with signs no one can read anymore.
world.trace.ruin.3 = Moss has covered everything. Only a worn threshold recalls that people once passed here.
world.trace.oldcamp.title = Old camp
world.trace.oldcamp.1 = Ashes of a fire, tent pegs: travellers slept here long ago.
world.trace.oldcamp.2 = A camp abandoned in haste. What made them flee?
world.trace.oldcamp.3 = The hunters of {village} stopped here, before the road changed.
world.trace.shrine.title = Forgotten shrine
world.trace.shrine.1 = A small shrine where offerings were left for travellers.
world.trace.shrine.2 = The monks of {village} came here to pray, they say.
world.trace.shrine.3 = The stone is still warm, as if someone just left.
world.trace.raid.title = Burnt trees
world.trace.raid.1 = Here, on the night of the raid on {village}, fire caught the trees. The villagers won't forget it.
world.trace.raid.2 = The blackened trunks bear the mark of the attackers who came to burn {village}.
world.trace.raid.3 = {village} was rebuilt, but these trees stay dead, in memory.
