spring.body1 = The Echo Seed made this spring well up. It still sings with the voice of the Kweebec Grandfather.
spring.body2 = Shelter: within {radius} blocks of the spring, the thirst of the Dunes does not take you, even at midday.
spring.body3 = The Feran know its song: you are at least Tolerated among them, and their merchants serve you.
spring.body4 = The jar fills one oasis waterskin a day: drunk, it keeps the thirst away for 20 minutes far from here.
spring.filled = You fill an oasis waterskin at the jar. Come back tomorrow for the next one.
spring.alreadyFilled = The jar fills slowly: come back tomorrow for another waterskin.
spring.orphan = This jar is dry: no Echo Spring here.
