dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.role = Voice of the monastery
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.accueil = Welcome… traveller. The board… says… what we need.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.voir = Show me the monastery's needs.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.quoi = How can I help?
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.explication = Three needs… each morning. Take one… no hurry. The chest on the square… takes everything.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.encours = Back… already?
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.rendre = Here is what I bring.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.rendu = Good… very good. The Void… steps back.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.aurevoir = Go… gently.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.honni = The Void… touched you. Or you… helped it. Come back… purified.
dialogue.Slothian_Crieur.racheter = I want to make amends.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.npc = Quiethand
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.role = merchant
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.honni = No.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.etranger = The monastery… does not trade… with strangers.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.commentAider = How do I make myself known?
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.conseil = The crier… by the board. One request… then two.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.voirDemandes = Show me the needs
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.accueil = Braziers… candles… all paid… in blessed ash.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.ami = For a friend… the monks' robe. The Void… dislikes the robe.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.hote = Our host… here are the weapons… of our old guardians.
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.troc = Let's see your wares
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.avance = And for friends?
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.reserve = Open the reserve for me
dialogue.Slothian_Marchand.aurevoir = Gently
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.npc = Heavypalm
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.role = Builder
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.accueil = One stone… then another. No hurry.
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.metier = I build… in basalt. The Void… gnaws wood.
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.chantier = A site… is open. I'm going… slowly.
dialogue.Slothian_Builder.statut = Here's… where we are.
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.npc = Patienteye
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.role = Watcher
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.accueil = Hush… I watch the rift.
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.metier = From the hide… I see the crystals grow. When they sing… the Void comes.
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.auxArmes = The Void rises! To the braziers!
dialogue.Slothian_Watcher.rumeur = Crawlers… prowl near the crystals. They wait… for night.
dialogue.Slothian_AshBearer.npc = Ashgrey
dialogue.Slothian_AshBearer.role = Ash bearer
dialogue.Slothian_AshBearer.accueil = Do you smell… the ash? It is blessed.
dialogue.Slothian_AshBearer.metier = I carry ashes… from braziers to walls. Where the ash goes… the Void does not.
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.npc = Stonearm
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.role = Guard
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.accueil = Halt… slowly.
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.metier = I hold the gate. My axe… is slow. But it always… falls.
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.auxArmes = The Void! Hold the gate… with me!
dialogue.Slothian_Guard.rumeur = Burnt skeletons… walk at night. They smell… our fires.
dialogue.Slothian_Breeder.npc = Quietstep
dialogue.Slothian_Breeder.role = Pen keeper
dialogue.Slothian_Breeder.accueil = Slowly… the beasts don't like… quick moves.
dialogue.Slothian_Breeder.metier = I keep the pen… Pigs, feathers, shells that burn… Everything serves… the vigil.
dialogue.Slothian_Monk.npc = Brother Breath
dialogue.Slothian_Monk.role = Monk
dialogue.Slothian_Monk.accueil = Sit… breathe. The Void… hates calm.
dialogue.Slothian_Monk.metier = I keep vigil… at the temple. While a monk watches… the rift sleeps.
dialogue.Slothian_Elder.npc = Mother Moss
dialogue.Slothian_Elder.role = Dean
dialogue.Slothian_Elder.accueil = Child… you walked… so far.
dialogue.Slothian_Elder.metier = I remember… before the rift. We were… many.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.npc = Abbot Heavy
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.role = Abbot of the monastery
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.aurevoir = Go… and keep watch.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.nouvelles = And the rift?
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.nouvellesTexte = It sleeps… badly. Each night… the Void pushes a little. Our braziers… hold it back.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.accepter = I'll take care of it.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.accepte = Good… take your time. But not too much.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.auxArmes = The Void is in the monastery! Defend the braziers!
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.honni = The Void… speaks through you. Leave.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etranger = A stranger… so far. The monastery guards a rift… we don't entrust it… to the first comer.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.commentAider = How do I earn your trust?
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.conseil = The board… slowly. Come back… when you are tolerated.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.voirDemandes = See the needs
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape1 = Our braziers… are hungry. Bring us sixteen ashes… and we'll know… you are staying.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.donner = Here are sixteen ashes.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.failDonner = you must be Tolerated by the Slothians and carry 16 Ash
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape2 = The braziers burn. But three anomaly crystals… have grown nearby. When you are our friend… break them.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape2EnCours = Three crystals… singing. Silence them.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape3 = The crystals are silent. But Brother Slowness… went to pray at them… and has not come back. Bring him home.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape3EnCours = Brother Slowness… waits somewhere. Bring him… to the heart of the monastery.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape4 = Brother Slowness saw… the rift opening. One night… the Void will rise. When you are our host… hold the temple with us.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape4EnCours = Tonight… the Void rises. Stay at the temple… by the braziers.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.etape4Attente = The Void will rise… but we have no vigil temple yet. Help the monastery… grow.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.recompense = You held. Take the Vigil… the Void's heart, purified by our prayers. We give it… only to a champion.
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.recevoir = Receive the Slothian Vigil
dialogue.Slothian_Chef.fin = You walked… from the meadow… to here. Every people… knows you. Watch… over them.
chain.Slothian.step1 = carry the ashes (16 Ash, Tolerated)
chain.Slothian.step2 = break 3 anomaly crystals (Friend)
chain.Slothian.step3 = bring back the lost monk (Friend)
chain.Slothian.step4 = hold the rift for a night (Host)
chain.Slothian.step5 = receive the Slothian Vigil (Champion)
