dialogue.job.aurevoir = Good work.
dialogue.job.metier = What do you do here?
dialogue.job.chantier = How is the building site going?
dialogue.Kweebec_Gardener.npc = Mousseline
dialogue.Kweebec_Gardener.role = Gardener
dialogue.Kweebec_Gardener.accueil = Watch your step, the sprouts are young!
dialogue.Kweebec_Gardener.metier = I tend the garden from dawn to dusk. The bigger the village grows, the more mouths to feed and rows to plant.
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.npc = Copeau
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.role = Builder
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.accueil = No building site today. I'm sorting wood while the gauge fills up.
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.chantier = We're growing! Don't trample the garden, young shoots are fragile.
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.statut = That's where we are. If a plot is cluttered, I leave it alone: we don't tear down other people's work.
dialogue.Kweebec_Builder.metier = When the village has gathered enough to grow, I sow around the future house: trunks rise, vines tie them together, and within a day it stands. Bring seeds and wood to the depot, it helps.
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.npc = Vigie
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.role = Lookout
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.accueil = Nothing to report… for now.
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.metier = I watch the edge of the woods from the tower. Trorks prowl, mostly at night.
dialogue.Kweebec_WellKeeper.npc = Rosée
dialogue.Kweebec_WellKeeper.role = Well keeper
dialogue.Kweebec_WellKeeper.accueil = The water is fresh today. Help yourself.
dialogue.Kweebec_WellKeeper.metier = I keep the well clean and carry water to the gardens. A hamlet without a well is just a camp.
dialogue.Kweebec_Breeder.npc = Trèfle
dialogue.Kweebec_Breeder.role = Breeder
dialogue.Kweebec_Breeder.accueil = Easy, you'll scare them.
dialogue.Kweebec_Breeder.metier = I look after the rabbits in the pen. They are smarter than they look.
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.npc = Épine
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.role = Guard
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.accueil = Halt. Oh, it's you. Go ahead.
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.metier = I hold the east tower and make my rounds. A growing village draws envy.
dialogue.Kweebec_Healer.npc = Camomille
dialogue.Kweebec_Healer.role = Healer
dialogue.Kweebec_Healer.accueil = You look tired. Sit down for a moment.
dialogue.Kweebec_Healer.metier = I tend the wounded and prepare sap ointments. From the great house, I hear the whole village.
dialogue.Kweebec_Elder.npc = Vieux-Nœud
dialogue.Kweebec_Elder.role = Elder of the Grandfather
dialogue.Kweebec_Elder.accueil = The Grandfather slept well. He can feel the grove has become a town.
dialogue.Kweebec_Elder.metier = I watch over the Grandfather, the oldest tree of the grove. As long as he lives, the village lives.
