dialogue.job.raid = Any news of the Trorks?
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.auxArmes = To arms! They're here! Hold the line with us!
dialogue.Kweebec_Guard.rumeur = The Trorks lit a fire to the east. Tonight smells of axes.
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.auxArmes = To arms! I can see them from the tower, there are many!
dialogue.Kweebec_Watcher.rumeur = I saw smoke behind the hills. A Trork camp, surely.
